##

00:00:00.197 --> 00:00:02.734 line:91%
Blimey, this satnav's taking us
down some back roads, isn't it?

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:05.400 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes, it's almost like I'm taking
you down a back road.</c>

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.800 line:91%
That <i>sounds</i><c.colorEEEEEE> rude.</c>
<c.cyan>It does.</c>

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.480 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's almost like
we're doing a rude trip.</c>

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.300 line:91%
We're driving from
Pratts Bottom to Balls Cross.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.770 line:85%
<c.cyan>The question is why?</c>

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.720 line:91%
Because I thought it was funny.
<c.cyan>'Cause it's funny, really.</c>

00:00:15.725 --> 00:00:16.767 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>'Cause we're children.</c>

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.305 line:91%
Along the way, we've both
picked out a couple of locations.

00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:21.525 line:91%
We haven't told the other
what those locations are.

00:00:21.525 --> 00:00:22.724 line:85%
We're gonna drive there.

00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:24.138 line:85%
You're gonna watch.

00:00:24.138 --> 00:00:25.605 line:85%
Or don't.

00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:28.095 line:91%
<c.cyan>It doesn't matter.
Just stay here, watch it.</c>

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:29.534 line:85%
<c.cyan>I don't know.</c>

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:30.634 line:91%
<c.cyan>Do we care?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>No.</c>

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.270 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay, to start, I'll drive first.</c>

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.170 line:91%
<c.cyan>I've got somewhere
I wanna take you.</c>

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.176 line:85%
Alright.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.590 line:91%
<c.cyan>Do I need to make the car noises?
Vroom, vroom, vroom.</c>

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.540 line:91%
I mean, the car's
gonna do that itself.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.680 line:85%
It's— It's a car.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.932 line:85%
It is a hybrid.

00:00:44.932 --> 00:00:47.835 line:91%
I didn't get a sports car
or anything for you, but...

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:48.810 line:85%
<c.cyan>Aw.</c>

00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:50.285 line:85%
<c.cyan>I might make them anyway.</c>

00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:51.215 line:85%
I mean, feel free.

00:00:51.695 --> 00:00:53.335 line:85%
I did no research by the way.

00:00:53.335 --> 00:00:55.162 line:91%
<c.cyan><i>(laughs heartily)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I have absolutely no idea</c>

00:00:55.162 --> 00:00:57.650 line:91%
why it's called Pratts Bottom.
<c.cyan>No, no!</c>

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.365 line:91%
We didn't talk to anyone there
to see if they find it funny.

00:01:00.365 --> 00:01:01.267 line:85%
We just...

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.125 line:91%
<c.cyan>We're just there
to amuse ourselves.</c>

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:04.457 line:85%
Yep.

00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:07.025 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>We are children.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>We're not even amusing you at this point.</c>

00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:09.192 line:85%
It's just— just for us.

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:11.586 line:91%
So we should explain
how this works.

00:01:11.586 --> 00:01:13.355 line:85%
I picked the start and end points.

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:15.215 line:91%
I picked Pratts Bottom
and Balls Cross.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.588 line:85%
And then I sent the route to Matt,

00:01:17.588 --> 00:01:21.435 line:91%
and we've both picked
a couple of locations on the way.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.525 line:91%
And you'll see the ones
that are vaguely entertaining.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.634 line:91%
And we haven't told each other
where we're going.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.780 line:91%
So Matt's starting off,
'cause he's taking me somewhere.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.287 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yep.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Later on, it'll be me.</c>

00:01:33.447 --> 00:01:34.800 line:91%
I said <i>we</i> should tell you
how that works.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.189 line:91%
That was just a monologue
