00:01:36.189 --> 00:01:37.693 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah it was,
but I am also trying</c>

00:01:37.693 --> 00:01:39.445 line:91%
<c.cyan>to navigate a roundabout
and work out where we're going.</c>

00:01:39.445 --> 00:01:40.269 line:85%
That's fair.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.803 line:91%
<c.cyan>The thing that I want to note,
really, is that I fully understand</c>

00:01:44.803 --> 00:01:47.718 line:91%
<c.cyan>that the one thing that
the internet needs right now</c>

00:01:47.718 --> 00:01:49.676 line:91%
<c.cyan>that it hasn't gotten enough of is</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Mhm. Yeah-yeah.</c>

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.770 line:85%
<c.cyan>two white men making toilet jokes.</c>

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.495 line:85%
Yep.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.118 line:85%
So we're going to Balls Cross.

00:01:55.118 --> 00:01:57.046 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(wheezes)</i></c>

00:01:57.046 --> 00:01:58.666 line:91%
<c.cyan>The one piece of advice
I have for you</c>

00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.394 line:91%
<c.cyan>is don't cross your balls
at Balls Cross.</c>

00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:03.110 line:91%
That's called testicular torsion,
and I wouldn't recommend it.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:04.520 line:91%
<c.cyan>I've had it before, you know.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Have you?</c>

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.067 line:91%
<c.cyan>I wouldn't recommend
it at all, no.</c>

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:08.549 line:91%
It's also a good name for a
death metal band, but you know.

00:02:08.549 --> 00:02:11.128 line:85%
<c.cyan>"Hello, we're Testicular Torsion!"</c>

00:02:11.128 --> 00:02:12.759 line:91%
<i>(imitates electric guitar)</i>
<c.cyan><i>(death metal growl)</i></c>

00:02:13.602 --> 00:02:15.045 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's the sound you make
when you've got it.</c>

00:02:15.045 --> 00:02:16.496 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>'Cause it's actually quite painful.</c>

00:02:17.355 --> 00:02:20.715 position:66% line:91%
<c.cyan>I thought I'd take you somewhere
there was something you'd like to look at.</c>

00:02:20.715 --> 00:02:21.693 line:85%
Alright.

00:02:22.305 --> 00:02:24.275 line:91%
<c.cyan>I think this is gonna be
